---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base title="Request a quote | CV and LinkedIn Studio" description="Enquiries for CV, cover letter, LinkedIn and interview prep support. Enquiries are opening soon; no payment is taken on this site.">
<h1>Request a quote</h1>
<p class="note"><strong>Enquiries open soon.</strong> We have not switched on an enquiry form yet, so there is nothing to submit today. Please check back shortly.</p>
<h2>What to have ready</h2>
<ul><li>Your current CV, or a list of your roles, dates and responsibilities</li><li>The kind of role you are aiming for</li><li>Which service you want: CV, cover letter, LinkedIn profile or interview prep</li></ul>
<p>This page only collects enquiries. No payment is taken here. Read <a href={withBase('how-it-works/')}>how it works</a> and the <a href={withBase('privacy/')}>privacy page</a> first.</p>
</Base>
